t cooked, then slice thinly."}, {"step": 2, "text": "Whisk the dressing — lime juice, fish sauce, palm sugar, garlic and chili — until the sugar dissolves."}, {"step": 3, "text": "Combine the pork with banana blossom, Asian basil, fried shallots."}, {"step": 4, "text": "Pour over the dressing and toss well just before serving."}, {"step": 5, "text": "Pile onto a plate and top with extra herbs, peanuts and fried shallots."}]}